Abstract . 𝔏 ν \mathfrak{L}_{
u} operator is an important extrinsic differential operator of divergence type and has profound geometric settings. In this paper, we consider the clamped plate problem of 𝔏 ν 2 \mathfrak{L}^{2}_{
u} operator on a bounded domain of the complete Riemannian manifolds. A general formula of eigenvalues of 𝔏 ν 2 \mathfrak{L}^{2}_{
u} operator is established.
